/Title (The Summary of Benefits and Coverage \(SBC\) document will help you choose a health plan. The SBC shows you how you and the plan would share the cost for covered health care services. NOTE: Information about the cost of this plan \(called the premium\) will be provided separately. This is only a summary. For more information about your coverage, or to get a copy of the complete terms of coverage, call Olive Branch Administrators at 844-500-8729 or visit brightlifehw.com. For general definitions of common terms, such as allowed amount, balance billing, coinsurance, copayment, deductible, provider, or other underlined terms, see the Glossary. You can view the Glossary at www.healthcare.gov/sbc-glossary or call Olive Branch Administrators at 844-500-8729 to request a copy)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 731 0 R
/First 1394 0 R
/Last 1395 0 R
/Count -3
>>
endobj
